push("ei82q", r`Source: Ryan T. Godwin, Econometrics I, section 8.2, p. 71. CC BY-NC-SA 4.0. https://rtgodwin.com/econometrics1.pdf`, r`In general, this estimator is biased. We can show it is consistent, however: plim n1 X ′ X = Q ; plim p.d. and finite Full rank of the instrument matrix, the relevancy of the I.V., and the exclusion restriction imply respectively that : Z Z = QZZ plim n1 Z ′ X = QZX plim n1 Z ′ ϵ = 0 plim p.d. and finite p.d. and finite`);

